<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<title>Name Change Forms</title>
<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, sans-serif;
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  h1, h2, h3 {
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, sans-serif;
    font-weight: bold;
  }
  .header-info {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  .logo-area {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .logo {
    width: 100px; /* Placeholder size */
    height: auto;
    margin-right: 15px;
  }
  .university-name {
    font-size: 24pt;
    line-height: 1;
  }
  .section-title {
    font-size: 14pt;
    font-weight: bold;
    margin-top: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  .divider {
    border-top: 1px solid #000;
    margin: 20px 0;
  }
  .form-label {
    display: inline-block;
    width: 150px;
    font-weight: normal;
  }
  .form-field {
    border-bottom: 1px solid #000;
    min-width: 200px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  .note {
    font-style: italic;
    margin-top: 15px;
    padding-left: 20px;
    border-left: 3px solid #000;
  }
  table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    margin-top: 15px;
  }
  td {
    padding: 5px 0;
    vertical-align: top;
  }
  .signature-line {
    border-bottom: 1px solid #000;
    width: 40%;
    margin-top: 50px;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="page">
  <div class="logo-area">
    <!-- Placeholder for Logo -->
    <div class="logo"></div>
    <div class="university-name">
      <span data-field="university_name_line1">{{ university_name_line1 }}</span><br>
      <span data-field="university_name_line2">{{ university_name_line2 }}</span><br>
      <span data-field="university_name_line3">{{ university_name_line3 }}</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="section-title">Human Resources Internal Operating Procedures</div>
  <div class="divider"></div>

  <p>Procedure 6.M: Name Change Procedure</p>
  <p>Volume <span data-field="procedure_volume">{{ procedure_volume }}</span></p>
  <p>Managing Office: Office of Human Resources</p>
  <p>Effective Date: <span data-field="effective_date">{{ effective_date }}</span></p>

  <h3 style="margin-top: 30px;">I. Purpose</h3>
  <p>This procedure will document the process and guidelines to change employee's name in Banner Human Resources/Payroll System, update taxes, and update benefits checklist.</p>

  <h3 style="margin-top: 30px;">II. Name Change Procedure for faculty and staff</h3>
  <p>Alabama A&M University employees who wish to change their name in the Banner Human Resources/Payroll system must first go to the local Social Security Administration office (SSA) to officially change their name. Once the SSA makes the change, the employee will be given a receipt confirming the name change. The employee should receive the official social security card reflecting the name change in the mail in a few weeks. Once the employee receives the official social security card, the employee should visit the Office of Human Resources and request that her/his name be changed in Banner Human Resources/Payroll system.</p>
  <p>The name change will be reflected immediately in Banner Human Resources/Payroll system after the Office of Human Resources receives the official documentation – Name Change Form and new Social Security Card.</p>

  <h3 style="margin-top: 30px;">Huntsville SSA Office Contact Information:</h3>
  <p>4970 Research Drive, NW</p>
  <p>Huntsville, AL <span data-field="zip_code">{{ zip_code }}</span></p>
  <p>P: <span data-field="phone_number">{{ phone_number }}</span></p>
  <p>TTY: <span data-field="tty_number">{{ tty_number }}</span></p>
  <p>Hours of operation:</p>
  <p>Monday, Tuesday, Thursday, and Friday 9:00 a.m. – 4:00 p.m.</p>
  <p>Wednesday 9:00 a.m. to 12:00 p.m.</p>
  <p>Additional information from the SSA regarding name change can be found at: <a href="<span data-field="ssa_link">{{ ssa_link }}</span>">{{ ssa_link">ssa_link</span> }}</a></p>

  <h3 style="margin-top: 30px;">III. Name Change Process for students</h3>
  <p>Students must contact the Office of the Registrar to make the necessary name change in the Banner Student system. For more information regarding changing a name in the Banner Student system, please contact the Office of the Registrar at 256-372-5254 or go to: <a href="<span data-field="registrar_link">{{ registrar_link }}</span>">{{ registrar_link">registrar_link</span> }}</a></p>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div class="header-info">
    <div class="logo-area">
      <!-- Placeholder for Logo -->
      <div class="logo"></div>
      <div class="university-name">
        <span data-field="university_name_line1">{{ university_name_line1 }}</span><br>
        <span data-field="university_name_line2">{{ university_name_line2 }}</span><br>
        <span data-field="university_name_line3">{{ university_name_line3 }}</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div style="text-align: right;">
      <p>Mailing Address: Human Resources, Alabama A&M University, Normal, AL <span data-field="zip_code">{{ zip_code }}</span></p>
      <p>Phone: <span data-field="phone_number">{{ phone_number }}</span></p>
      <p>Fax: <span data-field="fax_number">{{ fax_number }}</span></p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <h2 style="text-align: center; margin-top: 40px;">Name Change Form</h2>

  <p>The employee will need to bring the following documents to the Office of Human Resources:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>The new Social Security Card that reflects the name change.</li>
    <li>This name change form.</li>
  </ul>

  <table style="margin-top: 20px;">
    <tr>
      <td style="width: 150px;">Date:</td>
      <td class="form-field"><span data-field="date_filed">{{ date_filed }}</span></td>
      <td style="width: 150px;">Banner ID#:</td>
      <td class="form-field"><span data-field="banner_id">{{ banner_id }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td style="width: 150px;">Current Name of employee:</td>
      <td class="form-field"><span data-field="current_first_name">{{ current_first_name }}</span></td>
      <td class="form-field"><span data-field="current_middle_name">{{ current_middle_name }}</span></td>
      <td class="form-field"><span data-field="current_last_name">{{ current_last_name }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td style="width: 150px;">Requested to be changed to:</td>
      <td class="form-field"><span data-field="new_first_name">{{ new_first_name }}</span></td>
      <td class="form-field"><span data-field="new_middle_name">{{ new_middle_name }}</span></td>
      <td class="form-field"><span data-field="new_last_name">{{ new_last_name }}</span></td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <div class="note">
    Note: If address and phone number changed, employee should log into Self-Service Banner (SSB) to change address and phone number.
  </div>

  <table style="margin-top: 50px;">
    <tr>
      <td style="width: 50%;">Signature of Employee</td>
      <td style="width: 50%;">Date</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td class="signature-line"></td>
      <td class="signature-line"></td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <h3 style="margin-top: 50px;">For the Office of Human Resources</h3>
  <p>Name of HR staff received form (Please print):</p>
  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-top: 10px;">
    <div style="width: 45%;"></div>
    <div style="width: 45%;"></div>
  </div>

  <p>Date HR staff reviewed the social security card:</p>
  <div class="form-field"><span data-field="hr_review_date">{{ hr_review_date }}</span></div>

  <p>Date HR staff updated Form I-9:</p>
  <div class="form-field"><span data-field="hr_i9_update_date">{{ hr_i9_update_date }}</span></div>

  <p>Date HR staff updated name on the employee's personnel and benefits file folder:</p>
  <div class="form-field"><span data-field="hr_file_update_date">{{ hr_file_update_date }}</span></div>

  <div style="margin-top: 50px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; font-size: 10pt;">
    <div style="text-align: left;">Alabama A&M University<br>Office of Human Resources</div>
    <div style="text-align: right;">Name Change Procedure and Form<br>February 2016</div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <h2 style="text-align: center;">Name Change Benefit Information Checklist</h2>

  <ol style="padding-left: 20px;">
    <li>The employee may wish to change his/her email address. If so, send an email to Ted Stewart in Information Technology System indicating the current name and the new name for the email address.</li>
    <li>The employee may wish to change his/her federal and state tax status in cases where the marriage status changed. The employee should complete a new Form A-4 for Alabama tax withholding and a new Form W-4 for federal withholding. The forms are located on the Office of Human Resources website and in the Office of Human Resources. After completing the form, submit the tax form(s) to the Payroll Department, Patton Hall, room 105.</li>
    <li>The employee may wish to change his/her beneficiary information. To change the beneficiary information for the life insurance, the <span data-field="guardian_beneficiary_designation_change_form">{{ guardian_beneficiary_designation_change_form }}</span> should be completed. The file is located in the Office of Human Resources or at <a href="<span data-field="guardian_link">{{ guardian_link }}</span>">{{ guardian_link">guardian_link</span> }}</a>.</li>
    <li>To change the beneficiary information for the Teachers' Retirement System, the <span data-field="rsa_form">{{ rsa_form }}</span> form should be completed. The file is located in the Office of Human Resources or at <a href="<span data-field="rsa_link">{{ rsa_link }}</span>">{{ rsa_link">rsa_link</span> }}</a>.</li>
    <li>If the employee has a voluntary retirement plan (TIAA-CREF, LSW, VALIC or ASPRIE), the employee should contact Mr. Wilbert Hamilton at 256.541.4565 for name change and applicable change beneficiary information.</li>
    <li>To change the name with Teachers' Retirement System of Alabama and PEEHIP health insurance, the employee must provide a copy of his/her social security card to TRS and PEEHIP. The change will automatically transmit to Blue Cross Blue Shield of Alabama and member will receive a new insurance card. Mail the documents to TRS, P.O. Box 302150, Montgomery, AL 36130-2150.</li>
    <li>To change the name with Guardian and Aflac, the <span data-field="guardian_enrollment_application">{{ guardian_enrollment_application }}</span> form should be completed. The form is located at <a href="<span data-field="aflac_guardian_link">{{ aflac_guardian_link }}</span>">{{ aflac_guardian_link">aflac_guardian_link</span> }}</a>.</li>
    <li>To change the beneficiary with Aflac, the <span data-field="beneficiary_change_form">{{ beneficiary_change_form }}</span> form should be completed. The form is located at <a href="<span data-field="aflac_beneficiary_link">{{ aflac_beneficiary_link }}</span>">{{ aflac_beneficiary_link">aflac_beneficiary_link</span> }}</a>.</li>
  </ol>

  <div style="margin-top: 60px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; font-size: 10pt;">
    <div style="text-align: left;">Alabama A&M University<br>Office of Human Resources</div>
    <div style="text-align: right;">Name Change Procedure and Form<br>February 2016</div>
  </div>
</div>

</body>
</html>